{"title":"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Methodic_Process)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Methodic Process)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a math competition, all teams must consist of between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> members, inclusive. Mr. Beluhov has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3d1431ad346632b25a0e7b3f12ebe19723b3960.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" /> students and he realizes that he cannot form teams so that each of his students is on exactly one team. Find the sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that the integers from 1 - 11 cannot be achieved. We similarly see that the integers from 16-23 cannot be reached. We then see that the integers from 31-35 cannot be reached. We then see that 46 and 47 cannot be reached. We then attempt to show that 61 can be reached. We see that 12x4 and 13 get the trick done. The answer is then 480.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Methodic_Process.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Methodic_Process)\">Solution 2 (Methodic Process)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Methodic Process)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> be the total number of students in his class. Then, that means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/b/1fb86c07b8e51d71a3c9776979ee34a83cd6f241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t\\pmod{12}&gt;3\\lfloor{\\frac{t}{12}}\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"161\" height=\"38\" />\nThis translates to when there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students on a team, there are more remaining students than slots on those teams, where each team has a maximum of three slots for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc50482fb1389e158cc0f62bb3c914664c276003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor{\\frac{t}{12}}\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"40\" height=\"38\" /> teams. Those three slots are the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />th <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/0/820a20de2847dfdc1bc5cffc8d904933150032bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />th and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />th members of the team. We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/e/23e900872296825e0494d91fe45c8df77bad537a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\lfloor{\\frac{t}{12}}\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"38\" /> has to be less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc50482fb1389e158cc0f62bb3c914664c276003.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor{\\frac{t}{12}}\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"40\" height=\"38\" /> is between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> inclusive. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/6/81668232b6bfad425f5162aada3755b151fd4507.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x= {0,1,2,3,}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" /> give the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/948b9ee1b808270bd4ba1dc7082da7d119c1b4e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/0/0f039bf3ab3f0d1442faced70828c50940f732c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16-23$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/9/5894c93c4d96d2dee9acf8d84e8ddcce83b4e72f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$31-35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/8/178f9bd5830835ed7c36efe3518e69797522090c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$46-47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" /> respectively. Adding these up, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/7/a472d133f4ab89020583f7ca46f2adc11e0aaac9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{480}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"40\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>-Magnetoninja\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I\" title=\"2020 CIME I\">2020 CIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 CIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2020\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2020 CIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"CIME Problems and Solutions\"> All CIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Template:MAC_Notice&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Template:MAC Notice (page does not exist)\">Template:MAC Notice</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018012958\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 183/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1475/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 108/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3941/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   10.905      1 -total\n 76.78%    8.373      1 Template:CIME_box\n 20.25%    2.208      1 Template:MAC_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_: